tion governance risk (6/10).","financial_summary":["Brookfield Asset Management Inc is a large-cap financial services business with a $84.6B market cap on $4.8B of annual revenue.","Returns on capital run at 47% against a 11% cost of capital \u2014 a 36-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat.","The business throws off $2.1B in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 43 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, with adequate 0.88\u00d7 cash conversion.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and interest coverage of 35\u00d7 is fortress-like.","Shareholder yield of 3.3% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and insiders hold 3.6% of the shares, and within its sector the business captures 2.4\u00d7 its fair share of profits, a structural advantage visible in the numbers."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 88% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away (confirmed by 2 other valuation measures)","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.8785285007305993},{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Payout ratio looks stretched \u2014 the dividend\u2019s own margin of safety is thin","sev":"red","cat":"dividend"},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 6.2% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Financial Services peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Operating margins 33% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","ROIC sits in the top quartile of Financial Services peers \u2014 the moat is wider than the neighbourhood","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Brookfield Asset Management Ltd (BAM) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Highlights: Record $123 Billion ...","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/brookfield-asset-management-ltd-bam-231524710.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1794006924.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.872,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Brookfield (BAM) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript","source":"fool.com","link":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/brookfield-bam-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/?source=iedfolrf0000001","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793991749.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.511,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Brookfield targets infrastructure flagship to exceed $30B in early 2027 as net carry is expected to total ~$3B in 2029-2031 (NYSE:BAM)","source":"seekingalpha.com","link":"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4668435-brookfield-targets-infrastructure-flagship-to-exceed-30b-in-early-2027-as-net-carry-is","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793990842.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.67,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Brookfield Asset Managem